<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Oil Search to release results Monday.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Oil Search to release results Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Papua New Guinea oil explorer and producer Oil Search Ltd said on Thursday the release of its full-year results had been delayed until Monday, March 3.</p>
<p>The results had been expected to be released today.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
